WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:02.178
Hey, welcome to Brief!

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:07.845
We all deal with important documents: contracts, agreements, leases, and other paperwork.

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:13.952
Understanding every detail, keeping it organized, and remembering important dates can be hard.

00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:15.899
That's where Brief comes in.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:21.372
Add a contract, a scan, or photos from your phone, and Brief reads it for you.

00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:25.365
It pulls out the key terms, each with the exact words behind it.

00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:29.807
Ask a question in plain words, and the answer shows the wording it came from.

00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:33.677
And if the document doesn't say, Brief tells you, instead of pretending.

00:00:35.700 --> 00:00:37.836
Everything you add stays in one place.

00:00:38.300 --> 00:00:44.327
Brief files each one by kind, and you can search, filter, rename, or open any document in a click.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:51.412
You can also set reminders for important dates and tasks, so you never miss what matters.

00:00:53.000 --> 00:01:00.790
Need to let someone see where your documents stand? Share your dashboard with family or friends, read only, for as long as you choose.

00:01:00.800 --> 00:01:03.355
And anything shared with you is listed right there.

00:01:05.300 --> 00:01:14.463
Your account security matters too. Brief also supports two-factor authentication with an authenticator app, adding an extra layer of protection.

00:01:15.900 --> 00:01:19.490
So now, nothing is scattered, and no important date slips by.

00:01:20.200 --> 00:01:26.794
Understand, organize, remember, and stay protected. That's Brief. Everything important, all in one place.
